Please let them come back,
all of them safe and soundly.

19
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,060
Damn, I can't get free!

20
00:02:15,660 --> 00:02:19,020
Now let's get this party started!

21
00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:49,320
I feel surprisingly calm.

22
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:54,000
After putting my team in danger,
I needed time to cool off.

23
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:57,455
My heart is on fire, but I
can fight with a level head.

24
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:11,760
Without Yuki, I've got less firepower
at my disposal, so that means...

25
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:21,694
For each and every person that you've
murdered, I'll slice you to pieces!

26
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,097
Not so.

27
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:43,580
Teleportation isn't the only
trick up her sleeve. Okay.

28
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:49,660
Superhuman speed.

29
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,845
I can't pinpoint her position.

30
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,220
That's my sister-in-law.

31
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,420
I'll go for a wider range.

32
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,630
There!

33
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:02,280
I missed her!

34
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,460
Amei na mitari!

35
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,205
That's an awful lot of damage.

36
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,517
I thought you and your friends lived here.

37
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,240
We're ditching this place.

38
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,579
They've already evacuated the area.

39
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,460
Over-consuming peaches is dangerous.

40
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:29,079
They've been my source of
energy since the accident.

41
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,960
I'll beat your ass!

42
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:41,787
Especially if you're a disgusting
bitch preying on my brother!

43
00:04:42,060 --> 00:04:42,890
Big sis!

44
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:48,237
Weapons in her arsenal, a resilient physical
form and a blast attack from her mouth.

45
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:52,967
She can harden and manipulate her hair,
and gain strength by consuming peaches.

46
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:54,280
Pretty impressive.

47
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:07,570
Ah!

48
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:18,170
But help!

49
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:21,800
When I eat peaches, it
heightens my senses too.

50
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,202
She's too fast for me to attack.

51
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,140
All you can do is bleed!

52
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:30,200
So I'll wear you down, then take you out!

53
00:05:32,740 --> 00:05:34,916
So it's a war of attrition she wants.

54
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:41,220
Unfortunately for her, as a commander,
I can teleport 666 times in a row.

55
00:05:42,500 --> 00:05:43,397
Comes with the territory.

56
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,656
Guess I'm holding out until Kyo wins.

57
00:05:47,540 --> 00:05:50,320
The moment I get a chance, I'll strike.

58
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:57,591
Hitting or grabbing me won't
work when my body is slippery.

59
00:05:58,060 --> 00:06:00,540
OK, then, without further delay!

60
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:02,240
Wa-bam!

61
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:15,120
Are you OK?

62
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,420
I am.

63
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,739
It really stings, but I'll be fine.

64
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:26,237
Sorry, but hitting me with a little
boulder isn't gonna do you much good.

65
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,320
Coco-choose,

66
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:31,997
thanks to the peaches, my stamina and
my regenerative abilities got enhanced.

67
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:34,440
And Kuma's even tougher than I am.

68
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:37,658
There's not a single scratch on her.

69
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:40,220
I just wanna get away and save Yuki.

70
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,324
You talking about Yuki, Wakura?

71
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:45,097
Yeah, that's right, the guy you kidnapped.

72
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,360
He better be safe.

73
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:49,785
Don't worry about him,
I licked him all better.

74
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,150
Licked him?

75
00:06:57,360 --> 00:07:02,000
Our boss is a soft spot for
him too. Soft spot? Come here.

76
00:07:04,020 --> 00:07:07,800
Yuki Wakura belongs to
us now, so give it up!

77
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:13,486
Their next targets are your
commanders, then the Onmyou Bureau.

78
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:18,297
We're gonna raise all kinds of hell,
so the whole country knows we exist!

79
00:07:18,380 --> 00:07:23,140
That massive Shuki, it's been
documented by the Defense Force before!

80
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:28,700
It was spotted in Amato Mishap
in Kagoshima eight years ago!

81
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:34,080
All threats to innocent lives end here!

82
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,140
Now that's more like it!

83
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:39,620
Remember what we discussed,
let's go with Formation S!

84
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,360
Are you sure? Huh?

85
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:46,600
We'll use Formation S to wipe the
floor with you pathetic pipsqueaks!

86
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:47,570
Excuse me!

87
00:07:47,653 --> 00:07:49,940
Bring it on, let's go!

88
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:02,020
Hey, does the S stand for see you later?

89
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,140
There she is!

90
00:08:09,440 --> 00:08:11,080
We're really doing this?

91
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,260
Polarize her, Kuma!

92
00:08:14,980 --> 00:08:16,280
Here comes!

93
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:22,340
Don't forget, I can shrink myself too!

94
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:25,800
The S in formation S stands for small!

95
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,820
And now, we grow!

96
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,680
Paradigm shift! Scrapped!

97
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:49,120
Crazy, she won!

98
00:08:52,820 --> 00:08:53,650
Idiot!

99
00:08:53,733 --> 00:08:55,053
That attack won't work!

100
00:08:57,380 --> 00:08:59,020
Crap, this isn't good!

101
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:21,800
You should never piss off a girl in love.

102
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:27,380
Which means you were
doomed from the start.

103
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:29,860
Or Shuki?

104
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,620
I might be in trouble.

105
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,550
Huh?

106
00:09:35,633 --> 00:09:36,463
Hang on, Sahara!

107
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,830
Uh!

108
00:09:49,460 --> 00:09:50,290
Uh!

109
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:52,730
Uh!

110
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,100
Uh! Uh! Uh! Timuri!

111
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:57,650
Ah!

112
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:01,780
Golden hour!

113
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,680
Rewind 5 seconds!

114
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:05,590
Woo!

115
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,030
Timuri!

116
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,120
More Shuki are hiding in the back!

117
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,030
What?

118
00:10:15,113 --> 00:10:17,500
Sneaking in from the hive? Cowards!

119
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:19,360
How did she know that?

120
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:25,520
My Hitori Shizuka lets me slip past humans
unnoticed, including the Onmio Bureau.

121
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:27,620
That little nuisance.

122
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,840
Where did that humanoid Shuki go?

123
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,240
Golden hour!

124
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,774
Free for five seconds!

125
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,020
Damn it!

126
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,600
They're targeting Himari!

127
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,510
Ah!

128
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:49,320
Yachi-ho, what just... Shut the hell up!

129
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:54,767
Listen to me, you need to stay
behind me so I can protect you!

130
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,940
Gold in the hour!

131
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,652
Freeze for five seconds!

132
00:11:03,220 --> 00:11:06,217
I've already used my ability
too many times in a row!

133
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:08,040
The humanoid, where is she?

134
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:10,570
Yachi-ho!

135
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:15,200
I'll grant you a beautiful death!

136
00:11:27,180 --> 00:11:29,121
I know you've been protecting me.

137
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,937
It's written all over your face.

138
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:32,560
But now it's my turn.

139
00:11:32,820 --> 00:11:35,660
A little sister can
protect her big sister too!

140
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,522
She disappeared into the ground!

141
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,000
This isn't effective enough.

142
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:52,615
I'll have to lure out the enemy first.

143
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:55,900
Hold on a second.

144
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:57,557
My ability's ready to go.

145
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:59,052
You need to stick close.

146
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,060
Don't you fret, Akura.

147
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:06,496
We'll capitalize on their weaknesses.

148
00:12:06,620 --> 00:12:08,120
Victory will be ours.

149
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,548
It's too big of a distance.

150
00:12:10,700 --> 00:12:12,420
Get closer to me! Like this?

151
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,915
Now this is an Azuma Battle Formation!

152
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,609
It's the ultimate defense!

153
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:20,357
If they launch an attack while I'm moving,

154
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:23,797
there's a small chance they'll
overpower me before I strike a pose.

155
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:27,292
But if I wait in this position,
I should be able to react!

156
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:30,482
Get cozy, come on, this
isn't the time to be shy!

157
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:32,730
No.

158
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:33,837
What's the matter?

159
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,797
The enemy could decide to ignore us.

160
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,957
And we can't let her
head for the commanders.

161
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:39,020
We have to move.

162
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:42,297
Okay, look, there's a limit to how
many times I can use my ability.

163
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:43,820
We have to be precise.

164
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,680
I have a plan.

165
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:48,797
A secret weapon I've been
saving for the right moment.

166
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:49,760
Secret weapon?

167
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:51,937
It'd be my first time using it in combat.

168
00:12:52,020 --> 00:12:54,726
But if it works, it'll
lure her out of hiding.

169
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:58,777
The question is, are you sure you can
actually pull something like that off?

170
00:12:58,860 --> 00:13:01,389
I'm not the same person
as I was back then.

171
00:13:01,740 --> 00:13:04,777
After joining the 7th Squad and
fighting in the Exhibition Match,

172
00:13:04,860 --> 00:13:06,448
I've become a lot stronger.

173
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:09,820
Please trust me on this. I can do it.

174
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:14,132
If you're that determined, then go ahead!

175
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:28,782
I'll never hit the enemy
if I'm shooting blindly.

176
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:30,470
But?

177
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,891
What if I shoot blindly in all directions?

178
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:42,860
Full burst fire!

179
00:13:54,540 --> 00:13:55,900
There she is!

180
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:59,920
Are you trying to kill yourself?

181
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:01,160
This is suicide!

182
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:03,460
That's not gonna happen!

183
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:07,920
Crime time!

184
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:11,040
Rewind for 10 seconds!

185
00:14:24,780 --> 00:14:26,220
The plan worked out.

186
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,891
You did an excellent job.

187
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:34,920
Above us to the right,
45 degrees! Right, fire!

188
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,880
Not bad, little sister.

189
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,117
I'll return the favor when we get back.

190
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:53,200
I'm still not going back
home with you, but thanks.

191
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:57,840
I have got to find Aoba.

192
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:17,600
A little space between
Kyo and the Unihorn.

193
00:15:17,940 --> 00:15:19,917
Exactly what I've been waiting for.

194
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,280
She tricked me?

195
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:28,220
She threw off her rhythm. Thank you.

196
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:32,480
I'm not letting you target me!

197
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:34,880
I know your moods inside and out.

198
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,520
Ame no mitori!

199
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:38,870
Ah!

200
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:01,900
Tenka! No!

201
00:16:23,220 --> 00:16:25,760
Her blast attack got faster, too.

202
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:39,740
Oops, looks like I
nicked you with my beam.

203
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:44,113
Why didn't you attack me when
you had the opportunity to?

204
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:49,520
If I'd finished you off, it would
have made Yuki really upset.

205
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:55,916
Even I was shocked that I
couldn't go through with it.

206
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:58,240
Careless mistake.

207
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,520
It's strange.

208
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:02,429
I've been having all
sorts of new feelings.

209
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:04,389
I can take care of myself.

210
00:17:04,740 --> 00:17:06,937
You don't need to worry about my life.

211
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:10,237
But I love that you took Yuki's
feelings into consideration.

212
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:11,960
I'm starting to like you.

213
00:17:14,500 --> 00:17:15,840
I see it.

214
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:18,560
Our bright future.

215
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,520
With my sister-in-law.

216
00:17:30,120 --> 00:17:31,280
Big sister.

217
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:34,197
You've dropped the sister chick already!

218
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,260
Are you okay?

219
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:39,367
Fighting might be difficult.

220
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:45,367
If you flee now, I'd be
willing to look away.

221
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:49,157
But we have not changed our
mind about storming the Bureau.

222
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,420
We will not retreat. Alva!

223
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,350
Coco?

224
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:57,960
They got me good. Same here. Not you too!

225
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:01,577
We used the rest of the Shuki
as decoys so we could escape!

226
00:18:01,660 --> 00:18:05,131
They killed Akura and they
followed us through the tunnels.

227
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:15,297
It seems as though your friends are
running on empty so let me ask you this?

228
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:16,677
Do you surrender?

229
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:18,120
You wish!

230
00:18:46,340 --> 00:18:49,460
Over here, say hello to the gods.

231
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:09,560
It was easy to find you on account
of that huge ruckus you made.

232
00:19:13,380 --> 00:19:15,200
Coco, no! Hold on!

233
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,180
They've got great vitality.

234
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:20,837
I'm thinking maybe we should bring
the two of them with us, just in case.

235
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:21,750
Wait a minute.

236
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:23,417
I thought they were your friends.

237
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:27,580
Please don't start lumping us in
with these inferior mutts. Behold!

238
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:30,317
The eight thunder gods stand before you.

239
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:32,812
We are the almighty leaders of the Shuki.

240
00:19:33,140 --> 00:19:34,980
They control the Shuki?

241
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:36,580
The eight thunder gods?

242
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:37,940
That's right.

243
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:40,880
It is our duty to destroy the human race.

244
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,940
We're divine beings.

245
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:51,060
Feel free to worship us.

246
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:54,970
Joru?

247
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:09,300
I don't care what you are.

248
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:11,900
I am a big sister!

249
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:22,670
Kitomaru?

250
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:24,180
What are you doing?

251
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:36,760
Oh, that?

252
00:20:37,260 --> 00:20:39,957
That Shuki has been bitten
by one of my snakes,

253
00:20:40,040 --> 00:20:43,040
thereby restoring to its
original murderous nature.

254
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,270
No!

255
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,700
Go on.

256
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,706
No need for you to hold back.

257
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:58,000
Do all the damage you want.

258
00:21:16,420 --> 00:21:18,880
Keep your hands off my sister!

259
00:21:22,820 --> 00:21:23,800
It's time.

260
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:25,320
Let's go.

261
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:29,540
Together we will force
them to bow down. Right!

262
00:21:32,020 --> 00:21:34,440
Prepare to die!

263
00:22:12,280 --> 00:22:13,720
Let's do it.

264
00:22:40,660 --> 00:22:41,977
Thank

265
00:22:42,060 --> 00:22:43,377
